# wq#3946 stage 2 -- packages purged from the stock Xubuntu 26.04 base before
# Limpet packages go in.
#
# No "install-wizard-spec.md section 6.1" exists anywhere in this repo to source
# this list from (confirmed by repo-wide grep; the same gap wq#3941 already hit
# and logged -- see kb/ISSUE-LOG.md row 1327). This list is therefore this
# ticket's own reasoned call, not a transcription: drop desktop-suite packages an
# appliance that boots straight to the Limpet panel (docs/desktop-spec.md) never
# needs, keep anything a.) the panel/greeter spec names outright or b.) an RE
# session plausibly wants (e.g. a terminal, a file manager). One package per
# line, apt purge argument syntax, comments allowed.

# Office suite -- the appliance is a dedicated RE box, not a desktop replacement.
libreoffice-core
libreoffice-common

# Groupware/mail clients -- no mail account is ever configured on this appliance.
thunderbird

# Games bundled by the xubuntu-desktop metapackage.
#
# xubuntu-icon-theme was listed here by wq#3946 under this comment. It is not a
# game -- it is the stock Xubuntu icon theme, and the greeter config this build
# ships (overlay/etc/lightdm/lightdm-gtk-greeter.conf) names an icon theme, so
# stripping icon themes here is the wrong direction. Removed by wq#4073; see
# reports/wq4073_judgment_wq3946_papirus_icon_theme.md.
gnome-mahjongg
gnome-mines
gnome-sudoku

# Printing/scanning stack -- no printer is ever attached to an RE appliance.
cups
cups-browsed
simple-scan

# Media players/transcoders not used by any Limpet component (HDMI capture
# goes through v4l2/the HAL, not a desktop media player).
rhythmbox
parole
